[b]0.2.7[/b]
[list]
[*]Card choices in event grids and other simple selection screens now use the game's confirmation button. You can revise your selection before confirming.
[*]Ancient gifts now require confirmation. With Hold to inspect enabled, hold an event option to read its tips; releasing after inspection won't select it.
[*]In Crystal Sphere, tap a cell to preview the affected area, then confirm to spend a use. Changing tools or canceling clears the preview. Repeated taps cannot submit another action while the reveal is running.
[/list]

[list]
[*]事件中的卡牌网格及其他简易选牌界面现在会显示游戏原生的确认按钮，确认前可以调整选择。
[*]古代人的赐福现在需要二次确认。开启“长按查看”后，可以长按事件选项阅读提示，查看后松手不会直接选择。
[*]水晶球现在先点格子预览影响范围，再确认消耗次数。切换工具或取消选择会清除预览，揭晓过程中连续点击不会重复提交操作。
[/list]
